# Sourced by ai/aliases.zsh, after ai/env.secrets.zsh — so anything set here
# overrides the generated copy. Gitignored: copy to ai/env.local.zsh and fill
# in. `chmod 600` it; these are plaintext secrets.
#
# Keys that live in the 1Password item ai/setup.sh reads do not belong here —
# setup.sh writes those to ai/env.secrets.zsh (mode 600, also gitignored) as
# one `export <LABEL>="..."` per password field, under the label verbatim.
# That includes DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, which backs the `ccd` provider in
# ai/claude/providers.zsh.
#
# This file is for the rest: a key not in that item, or a temporary override.
#
# export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."
